  "cardType": "FORMULA",
  "front": "Product rule",
  "back": "$\\dfrac{d}{dx}(uv) = u\\dfrac{dv}{dx} + v\\dfrac{du}{dx}$",
  "notes": "Not in Cambridge's List of formulas.",
