  "front": "Quotient rule",
  "back": "$\\dfrac{d}{dx}\\left(\\dfrac{u}{v}\\right) = \\dfrac{v\\frac{du}{dx} - u\\frac{dv}{dx}}{v^2}$",
  "notes": "Bottom times derivative of top, minus top times derivative of bottom, over bottom squared.",
